    <!-- EN: Select Traits to Spare from Slaughter -->
  <AnimalTraits_SpareDialogTitle>选择保留免屠宰的特性</AnimalTraits_SpareDialogTitle>
    <!-- EN: Animals with any of the selected traits will be protected from auto-slaughter.\nThis applies to all tamed animals in your colony. -->
  <AnimalTraits_SpareDialogDesc>拥有任一选中特性的动物将受到保护，免于自动屠宰。\n这适用于殖民地中所有已驯服的动物。</AnimalTraits_SpareDialogDesc>
    <!-- EN: Select Traits to Cull -->
  <AnimalTraits_CullDialogTitle>选择要汰换的特性</AnimalTraits_CullDialogTitle>
    <!-- EN: Animals with any of the selected traits will be automatically marked for slaughter.\nTraits configured to spare animals take precedence over culling. -->
  <AnimalTraits_CullDialogDesc>拥有任一选中特性的动物将被自动标记为屠宰。\n配置为保留动物的特性优先于汰换。</AnimalTraits_CullDialogDesc>
